        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-016910",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In December 2024, we believe we achieved a historic milestone by becoming the first company to deploy customer-owned and -operated driverless trucks in commercial service.",
        "start_character": 2793,
        "end_character": 2964
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-016910",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-016910-8abcc668e130caa7",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-016910",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Since 2019, we have hauled commercial freight for our extensive customer base and, we currently offer regular service between our Dallas hub and Houston, Oklahoma City and Atlanta and recently expanded our service offering to El Paso.",
        "start_character": 26922,
        "end_character": 27156
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-016910",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-016910-8abcc668e130caa7",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-016910",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are able to operate our driverless trucking business today as regulators continue to work towards developing regulatory frameworks specifically for AV deployment.",
        "start_character": 33919,
        "end_character": 34084
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-016910",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-016910-8abcc668e130caa7",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-016910",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We designed modular hardware that is easy to service and maintain without the need for specialized technicians.",
        "start_character": 11667,
        "end_character": 11778
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-016910",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-016910-8abcc668e130caa7",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-016910",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We designed the Kodiak Driver with our customers in mind, leveraging our team’s experience deploying and operating real-world products.",
        "start_character": 7415,
        "end_character": 7550
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-016910",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-016910-8abcc668e130caa7",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-016910",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have also previously operated consistent service between Dallas and San Antonio, and piloted deliveries between California and Florida.",
        "start_character": 27157,
        "end_character": 27295
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-016910",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-016910-8abcc668e130caa7",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-016910",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have enhanced this capability by developing an end-to-end service capability, which we call Assisted Autonomy.",
        "start_character": 12543,
        "end_character": 12656
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-016910",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-016910-8abcc668e130caa7",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-016910",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Additionally, we take commercially reasonable steps designed to secure and protect our intellectual property rights, including through agreements with our commercial partners, supply-chain vendors, employees and consultants, and by maintaining our software in an access-controlled proprietary cloud environment.",
        "start_character": 33037,
        "end_character": 33348
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-016910",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-016910-8abcc668e130caa7",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-016910",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Each of these sensors has its own strengths and benefits, and we purposefully arrange them with overlapping fields of view designed to improve safety.",
        "start_character": 21014,
        "end_character": 21164
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-016910",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-016910-8abcc668e130caa7",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-016910",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Furthermore, we have established a strong set of principles, policies and procedures designed to promote safety throughout our organization.",
        "start_character": 17188,
        "end_character": 17328
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-016910",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-016910-8abcc668e130caa7",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-016910",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In our long-haul operations, we are currently operating revenue-generating commercial operations with Kodiak-owned autonomous trucks.",
        "start_character": 26788,
        "end_character": 26921
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-016910",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-016910-8abcc668e130caa7",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-016910",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "To that end, we developed the Kodiak Driver, a virtual driver that combines advanced AI-powered software with modular and vehicle-agnostic hardware designed to help address our customers’ needs.",
